{"id":"legacy-recipe-65a14c7e-0559-45f0-adfe-589551ca499c","version":1,"category":"roof-outdoor","when":"Existing outdoor-living recipe; original compatible scales: mansion.","title":"Caribbean Hillside Dining Pavilion 02","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"within 10 m with direct service path\",\"target\":\"outdoor-kitchen\"},{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"provide level, slip-resistant dining surface\",\"target\":\"patio\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"covering table and circulation edge\",\"target\":\"pergola\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"set above or beside pool with open ocean outlook\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"layer warm overhead and pathway lighting\",\"target\":\"light\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"screen service and vehicle noise from dining area\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Place on the ocean-facing side of the house with a level retained platform. Orient the long table parallel to the primary view rather than blocking it. Use a ventilated pergola with adjustable shade for tropical sun and brief rain. Keep the kitchen service route direct, step-free, and visually discreet. Protect the uphill edge from gusts using louvers or layered tropical planting. Maintain an unobstructed circulation band around the table and toward the view edge.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"diningAreaWidth\",\"max\":14,\"min\":5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":8},{\"key\":\"diningAreaDepth\",\"max\":10,\"min\":4,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":6},{\"key\":\"tableSeatCount\",\"max\":20,\"min\":8,\"unit\":\"count\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"pergolaCoverage\",\"max\":90,\"min\":35,\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":65},{\"key\":\"viewEdgeClearance\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.5},{\"key\":\"kitchenDistance\",\"max\":10,\"min\":2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":5},{\"key\":\"ambientLightingLevel\",\"max\":150,\"min\":30,\"unit\":\"lux\",\"value\":80},{\"key\":\"windScr